{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## S03 · 6 Break it and repair it\n*Guide: Step 6.*",
      "id": "class_s03_break_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⚠ Feedback from the engine\n{{fbBreak}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbBreak = null or fbBreak = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s03_break_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_break_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Done when\n- the engine saw a condition incident in **student-request**\n- no instance is still stopped at that incident (you cancelled it)\n- your latest version has its two default flows again",
      "id": "class_s03_break_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_break_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Questions\nAnswer from what you saw.",
      "id": "class_s03_break_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "deployError",
      "label": "1. When the arrow rejected was neither default nor conditional, the deploy...",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "failed: the arrow must have a condition or be the default flow",
          "value": "rejected"
        },
        {
          "label": "worked, with a warning",
          "value": "ok"
        },
        {
          "label": "worked: the engine ignores that arrow",
          "value": "ignored"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_break_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "incidentMsg",
      "label": "2. With the arrow deleted and the request rejected, Operate showed...",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "an incident at Approved?: no condition was true and there was no default flow",
          "value": "noFlow"
        },
        {
          "label": "the token waiting at Approved?, without an incident",
          "value": "waiting"
        },
        {
          "label": "the instance completed through Register decision",
          "value": "approved"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_break_7"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s03-break",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
